# Module 10 — Production Deployment. Keeps the Docker build context (sent
# to the daemon before any layer caching kicks in) small — without this,
# every `docker build` from the repo root would ship the entire installed
# node_modules tree, .git history, and every app's local build output.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/generated
.git
.github
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
target
**/target
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target
